---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const title = "Whip Cracking | Flux Entertainment";
const description = "Rhythmic whip cracking & fire whip acts from Flux Entertainment, a highly technical artform deeply embedded in Australian culture. Day shows & fire whip add-ons.";
---
<Layout title={title} description={description}>
  <Fragment slot="page-style">
<style is:global>
  .svc-hero{
    position:relative; min-height:60vh; padding-top:140px; padding-bottom:60px; overflow:hidden;
    background:var(--void);
  }
  .svc-hero-video{position:absolute; inset:0; width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; object-position:center top; z-index:0;}
  .svc-hero-overlay{
    position:absolute; inset:0; z-index:1;
    background:
      linear-gradient(to top, rgba(10,9,8,0.97) 0%, rgba(10,9,8,0.65) 55%, rgba(10,9,8,0.45) 100%),
      radial-gradient(ellipse 70% 60% at 75% 25%, rgba(140,26,26,0.35) 0%, rgba(10,9,8,0) 65%);
  }
  .svc-hero h1{font-size:clamp(2.6rem, 6vw, 5rem); color:var(--bone); max-width:820px;}
  .svc-breadcrumb{color:var(--ash-dim); font-size:0.82rem; margin-bottom:20px;}
  .svc-breadcrumb a{color:var(--ash-dim);}
  .svc-breadcrumb a:hover{color:var(--gold);}

  .svc-photo{
    aspect-ratio:3/4; background:
      radial-gradient(circle at 30% 20%, rgba(214,40,40,0.35), transparent 60%), var(--char-2);
    border:1px solid #2A231F;
  }
  .options-grid{display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr; gap:0; position:relative; z-index:2; margin-top:26px; max-width:640px;}
  .option-item{display:flex; align-items:center; gap:14px; padding:14px 0; border-top:1px solid #29221E; color:var(--ash); font-size:0.98rem;}
  .option-item svg{width:18px; height:18px; color:var(--gold); flex-shrink:0;}

  .photo-row{display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr); gap:20px; position:relative; z-index:2;}
  .photo-row .svc-photo{aspect-ratio:4/3;}

  .highlight-block{
    border-left:2px solid var(--flame); padding:6px 0 6px 28px; margin-top:50px;
    position:relative; z-index:2;
  }
  .highlight-block p{color:var(--ash); font-size:1.05rem; line-height:1.6;}

  .sfx-callout{
    margin-top:50px; border:1px solid #2A231F; padding:32px; display:flex; align-items:center;
    justify-content:space-between; gap:24px; flex-wrap:wrap; position:relative; z-index:2;
  }
  .sfx-callout p{color:var(--ash); max-width:560px; font-size:0.98rem;}
  .sfx-callout p strong{color:var(--bone);}

  @media (max-width:860px){
    .options-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
    .photo-row{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;}
    .about-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
  }
</style>
  </Fragment>
<main id="top">

  <!-- SERVICE HERO -->
  <section class="svc-hero">
    <video class="svc-hero-video" autoplay muted loop playsinline aria-label="Flux Entertainment whip cracking performance at a rodeo arena">
      <source src="https://videos.fluxentertainment.com.au/whip-hero.mp4" type="video/mp4">
    </video>
    <div class="svc-hero-overlay"></div>
    <div class="mark-bg" style="top:-150px; right:-200px; opacity:0.3; z-index:1;"></div>
    <div class="wrap" style="position:relative; z-index:2;">
      <div class="svc-breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a> / <a href="/#services">Entertainment</a> / Whip Cracking</div>
      <span class="mono eyebrow">Entertainment</span>
      <h1 style="margin-top:18px;">Whip Cracking</h1>
      <p class="hero-sub" style="margin-top:22px;">A relatively dangerous and highly technical artform deeply embedded in Australian culture, we love all things whips.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn-primary">Book Now</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- STORY -->
  <section class="about" style="padding-top:70px; padding-bottom:50px;">
    <div class="mark-bg" style="top:10%; left:-350px; opacity:0.25;"></div>
    <div class="wrap about-grid">
      <div class="about-copy">
        <p>From rhythmic whip cracking and whip cracking stunts to raging fireballs off the end of a fire whip, we love all things whips.</p>
        <p>It's often the act people remember most, a sharp, sudden crack cuts through a crowd in a way fire and pyrotechnics can't. We use it as a punchy opener, a rhythmic interlude between bigger moments, or a fire-laced finale that closes a show on a bang.</p>
        <p>Whip cracking runs deeper in Flux than our socials might suggest, our headquarters sits in rural Australia, where the whip is practically part of the landscape, and it's consistently one of our most requested acts. Our performers aren't just competent with a whip, they're some of the sharpest in the business, and it shows the moment they start cracking.</p>
        <p>Whip cracking is a relatively dangerous and highly technical artform that is deeply embedded in Australian culture. We can provide anything from standalone whip cracking day shows to fire whip cracking add-ons to other Flux performances.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn-ghost" style="display:inline-block; margin-top:10px;">Enquire About This Show</a>
      </div>
      <div class="svc-photo" style="overflow:hidden;">
        <video autoplay muted loop playsinline aria-label="Flux Entertainment whip cracking performer close-up" style="width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover; object-position:center;">
          <source src="https://videos.fluxentertainment.com.au/whip-paragraph-video.mp4" type="video/mp4">
        </video>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- AVAILABLE OPTIONS -->
  <section class="provide" style="padding-top:60px; background:
      linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(10,9,8,0.6) 0%, rgba(10,9,8,0.92) 70%, var(--void) 100%),
      url('/images/be8cad6ea2b6b4cb.jpg');
      background-size:cover; background-position:40% center; background-repeat:no-repeat;">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="section-head">
        <span class="mono eyebrow">What's Included</span>
        <h2 style="margin-top:18px;">Available Options</h2>
      </div>
      <div class="options-grid">
        <div class="option-item"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Day whip cracking shows / demonstrations</div>
        <div class="option-item"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Whip cracking add-ons to other Flux shows</div>
        <div class="option-item"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Rhythmic whip cracking &amp; whip cracking stunts</div>
        <div class="option-item"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"/></svg>Fire whip cracking add-ons to other Flux shows</div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- FEATURE VIDEO -->
  <section style="padding-top:70px; padding-bottom:70px; background:var(--char);">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div style="aspect-ratio:16/9; background:var(--char-2); border:1px solid #2A231F; overflow:hidden; margin-bottom:50px;">
        <video id="whipFeatureVideo" muted loop playsinline aria-label="Flux Entertainment whip cracking show reel" style="width:100%; height:100%; object-fit:cover;">
          <source src="https://videos.fluxentertainment.com.au/whip-for-web.mp4" type="video/mp4">
        </video>
      </div>

      <div class="highlight-block">
        <p>Having worked with some of Australia's biggest names in private capacities, Flux Entertainment provides a dynamic entertainment excellence.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="sfx-callout">
        <p>Enhance your experience even further with <strong>Flux SFX</strong>: choreographed fireworks, flame effects, and stage effects that elevate any performance into something even more immersive.</p>
        <a href="https://www.fluxsfx.com.au" target="_blank" rel="noopener" class="btn-ghost">Explore Flux SFX</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- TRUSTED BY -->
  <div class="trust" style="margin-top:0;">
    <div class="trust-label mono">Who We've Worked With</div>
    <div class="marquee-track">
      <div class="logo-box client"><img src="/images/057c0d093231835b.png" alt="ACT Government logo"></div>
      <div class="logo-box client"><img src="/images/2781323574911132.png" alt="Brisbane Heat logo"></div>
      <div class="logo-box client"><img src="/images/7e444706e9fd936d.png" alt="Royal Queensland Exhibition (Ekka) logo"></div>
      <div class="logo-box client"><img src="/images/94af0f4b50393493.png" alt="Fireball Whisky logo"></div>
      <div class="logo-box client"><img src="/images/023c8da67db3aae7.png" alt="Channel 7 logo"></div>
      <div class="logo-box client"><img src="/images/c1c77889d27166d4.png" alt="Fox Sports logo"></div>
      <div class="logo-box client"><img src="/images/aad8c04c03f5d889.png" alt="Fremantle logo"></div>
      <div class="logo-box client"><img src="/images/f4e823ed10d5037c.png" alt="Hancock Prospecting logo"></div>
      <div class="logo-box client"><img src="/images/d703f20d36cfb81f.png" alt="Hungry Jack's logo"></div>
      <div class="logo-box client"><img src="/images/7dd2874bad0a1fb3.png" alt="Lenovo logo"></div>
      <div class="logo-box client"><img src="/images/87ab8b663337bae0.png" alt="National Basketball League logo"></div>
      <div class="logo-box client"><img src="/images/0f97e57c499f7e9b.png" alt="Outback Queensland logo"></div>
